---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import Callout from '../../components/Callout.astro';
import ExternalLink from '../../components/ExternalLink.astro';
import release from '../../data/release.json';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Project"
  description="Residiuum source, multi-tier licensing, contributing, releases, and project links."
  path="/project/"
  eyebrow="Project"
  lead="Source of truth lives in the repository. This page points; it does not invent governance."
>
  <h2>Source</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      Repository:
      <ExternalLink href={release.github}>github.com/frogfishio/dingodb</ExternalLink>
    </li>
    <li>
      Releases:
      <ExternalLink href={release.githubReleases}>GitHub Releases</ExternalLink>
      (artifact policy in-repo)
    </li>
    <li>
      Documented product version: <code>{release.productVersion}</code>
    </li>
    <li>
      Website revision: <code>{release.sourceRevision}</code>
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Contributing</h2>
  <p>
    Implementation work should map to named specification sections. Engineering
    rules (SDA purity, authority before acceleration, damage honesty) are in
    the contributing guide.
  </p>
  <p>
    <ExternalLink href={release.github + '/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md'}>
      CONTRIBUTING.md
    </ExternalLink>
  </p>
  <Callout title="Code of conduct">
    <p>
      A standalone code of conduct is not yet published in the repository. When
      one lands, it will be linked here.
    </p>
  </Callout>

  <h2 id="licensing">Licensing</h2>
  <p>
    The workspace is <strong>not</strong> under a single uniform license. Crate
    licenses differ by tier:
  </p>
  <div class="table-wrap" role="region" aria-label="License tiers" tabindex="0">
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th scope="col">Tier</th>
          <th scope="col">SPDX</th>
          <th scope="col">Covers (summary)</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td>SDA / wire / thin client</td>
          <td>MIT</td>
          <td>SDA language, format codec, thin client</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Embedded store / examine / SDK default</td>
          <td>MPL-2.0</td>
          <td>Store, examination, collection SDK (default features)</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Networked product</td>
          <td>AGPL-3.0-or-later</td>
          <td>Cluster, server, operator CLI; SDK <code>cluster</code> feature</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
  <p>
    <ExternalLink href={release.github + '/blob/main/LICENSE'}>LICENSE</ExternalLink>
    ·
    <ExternalLink href={release.github + '/blob/main/doc/LICENSING.md'}>
      doc/LICENSING.md
    </ExternalLink>
  </p>

  <h2>Governance and maintainers</h2>
  <p>
    Public maintainer roster and formal governance documents are
    <strong>not yet published</strong> beyond repository ownership and commit
    history. Do not invent organizational claims.
  </p>

  <h2>Changelog</h2>
  <p>
    Prefer GitHub releases and repository history for change notes until a
    dedicated changelog path is published.
  </p>
  <p>
    <ExternalLink href={release.githubReleases}>Release notes</ExternalLink>
  </p>

  <div class="btn-row">
    <ExternalLink href={release.github} class="btn btn-primary">
      View source
    </ExternalLink>
    <ExternalLink href={release.docsBase + '/'} class="btn btn-secondary">
      Documentation
    </ExternalLink>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
